  "job_B14.9_20251003_114319": {
    "text": "\u00c6\u00feelstanes ger\u00e6nesse.\n\u00c6rest \u00fe\u00e6t mon ne sparige n\u00e6nne \u00feeof \u00fee \u00e6t h\u00e6bbendre honda gefongen sy, ofer XII winter & ofer eahta\n& gif hit hwa do, forgylde \u00f0one \u00feeof be his were & ne beo \u00feam \u00feeofe no \u00f0e ge\u00feingodre o\u00fe\u00fee hine be\nGif he hine \u00feonne werian wille o\u00f0\u00f0e o\u00f0fleo, \u00f0onne ne sparige hine mon.\nGif mon \u00f0eof on carcerne gebringe, \u00f0\u00e6t he beo XL nihta on carcerne, & hine mon \u00f0onne lyse ut mid\n& gif he ofer \u00f0\u00e6t stalige, forgildon hy hine be his were o\u00fe\u00fee hine eft \u00f0\u00e6r inne gebringan.\n& gif hine hwa forstonde, forgilde hine be his were, swa \u00feam cyninge swa \u00f0am \u00f0e hit mid ryhte\nOnd we cw\u00e6don be \u00feam hlafordleasan mannum, \u00f0e mon nan ryht \u00e6tbegytan ne m\u00e6g, \u00fe\u00e6t mon beode\n& gif hi hine \u00f0onne begytan nyllen o\u00f0\u00f0e ne m\u00e6gen to \u00feam andagan, \u00f0onne beo he sy\u00fe\u00fean flyma, &\n& se \u00f0e hine ofer \u00f0\u00e6t feormige, forgylde hine be his were o\u00fe\u00fee he hine be \u00f0am ladige.\nBe ryhtes w\u00e6rnunge.\nSe hlaford se ryhtes wyrne ond for his yfelan mon licge: & mon \u00f0one cing foresece, forgilde \u00fe\u00e6t\n& se \u00f0e \u00f0one cyng sece, \u00e6r he him ryhtes bidde swa oft swa him togebyrie, gilde \u00f0\u00e6t ilce wite \u00fee se o\u00feer\n& se hlaford \u00fee his \u00f0eowan \u00e6t \u00feyf\u00fee gewita sy, & hit him on open wur\u00f0e, \u00f0olige \u00f0\u00e6s \u00feeowan & beo\n& eac swilce cynges hordera o\u00f0\u00f0e ure gerefena, swilc \u00f0\u00e6re \u00f0eofa gewita w\u00e6re \u00f0e staledon, beo he be\nBe hlafordsearwum.\nOnd we cw\u00e6don be hlafordsearwe, \u00f0\u00e6t he beo his feores scyldig, gif he his \u00e6tsacan ne mihte o\u00fe\u00fee eft on\n& we cw\u00e6don be ciricbryce: gif he ful w\u00e6re on \u00f0am \u00f0ryfealdan ordale, bete be \u00feam \u00fee sio domboc\nBe wiccecr\u00e6ftum.\nOnd we cw\u00e6don be \u00feam wiccecr\u00e6ftum & be liblacum & be mor\u00f0d\u00e6dum, gif mon \u00fe\u00e6r acweald w\u00e6re, &\nGif he \u00feonne \u00e6tsacan wille & on \u00f0am \u00ferimfealdum ordale ful weor\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t he beo CXX nihta on\nBe bl\u00e6serum.\n\u00d0a blysieras ond \u00fea \u00f0e \u00f0eof wrecen, beon \u00fe\u00e6s ilcan ryhtes wyr\u00f0e.\n& se \u00fee \u00f0eof wrecan wille & nanne mon ne gewundige, gesylle \u00feam cyninge CXX scillinga to wite for\n& we cw\u00e6don be \u00f0am anfealdum ordale \u00e6t \u00feam monnum \u00fee oft betihtlede w\u00e6ron: & hy fule wurdon &\nBe landleasum mannum.\nOnd we cw\u00e6don, gif hwylc londleas mon folgode on o\u00fere scire & eft his m\u00e6gas gesece, \u00fe\u00e6t he hine on\nBe yrfes \u00e6tfenge.\nSe \u00f0e yrfe befo, nemne him mon V men his neahgebura, & begite \u00f0ara V: I, \u00f0\u00e6t him midswerige, \u00fe\u00e6t he\n& se \u00fee hit him geagnian wille, nemne him mon X men, & begite \u00feara twegen & sylle \u00feone a\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t hit\nBe hwearfe.\n& nan mon ne hwyrfe nanes yrfes buton \u00f0\u00e6s gerefan gewitnesse o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6ssepreostes o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s\nGif hit hwa do, gesylle XXX scillinga to wite, & fo se londhlaford to \u00feam hwearfe.\nBe wore gewitnesse.\nGif mon \u00feonne afinde, \u00fe\u00e6t heora \u00e6nig on wore gewitnesse w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6fre his gewitnes eft noht ne\nOnd we cw\u00e6don: se \u00f0e scyldunga b\u00e6de \u00e6t ofslagenum \u00feeofe, \u00f0\u00e6t he eode \u00f0reora sum to, twegen on\n& hy gan si\u00f0\u00f0an XII sume & gescyldigen hine, swa hit \u00e6r gecweden w\u00e6s; & gif \u00f0\u00e6s deadan m\u00e6gas\nOnd we cw\u00e6don, \u00fe\u00e6t mon n\u00e6nne ceap ne geceapige buton porte ofer XX penega; ac ceapige \u00f0\u00e6r\nOnd we cwe\u00f0a\u00fe, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00e6lc burh sy gebet XIIII niht ofer gongdagas.\nO\u00feer: \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc ceaping sy binnon port.\nBe myneterum.\n\u00deridda: \u00fe\u00e6t an mynet sy ofer eall \u00f0\u00e6s cynges onweald; & nan mon ne mynetige buton on port.\n& gif se mynetere ful wur\u00f0e, slea mon of \u00fea hond, \u00f0e he \u00f0\u00e6t ful mid worhte, & sette up on \u00f0a\n& gif hit \u00feonne tyhtle sy, & he hine ladian wille, \u00f0onne ga he to \u00feam hatum isene & ladige \u00fea hond,\n& gif he on \u00feam ordale ful wur\u00f0e, do mon \u00fe\u00e6t ilce, swa hit \u00e6r beforan cw\u00e6\u00f0.\nOn Cantwarabyrig VII myneteras: IIII \u00f0\u00e6s cynges & II \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes, I \u00f0\u00e6s abbodes; to Hrofeceastre:\nFeor\u00f0e: \u00fe\u00e6t nan scyldwyrhta ne lecge nan scepes fel on scyld; & gif he hit do, gilde XXX scillinga.\nFifte: \u00f0\u00e6t \u00e6lc mon h\u00e6bbe \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re syhl II gehorsede men.\nSyxte: Gif hwa \u00e6t \u00feeofe medsceat nime & o\u00feres ryht afylle, beo he his weres scyldig.\nSeofo\u00f0e: \u00fe\u00e6t nan mon ne sylle nan hors ofer s\u00e6, buton he hit gifan wille.\nOnd we cw\u00e6don be \u00feeowan men, gif he ful wur\u00fee \u00e6t \u00feam ordale, \u00fe\u00e6t mon gulde \u00fe\u00e6t ceapgild &\nGif hwa gemot forsitte \u00feriwa, gilde \u00f0\u00e6s cynges oferhyrnesse; & hit beo seofon nihtum \u00e6r geboden, \u00e6r\nGif he \u00feonne ryht wyrcan nylle ne \u00fea oferhyrnesse syllan, \u00feonne ridan \u00fea yldestan men to, ealle \u00fee to\nGif hwa \u00feonne nylle ridan mid his geferan, gilde cynges oferhyrnesse.\nOnd beode mon on \u00feam gemote, \u00f0\u00e6t mon eal fri\u00feige, \u00fe\u00e6t se cyng fri\u00feian wille; & forga \u00feyf\u00f0e be his\n& se \u00fee be witum geswican nylle, \u00f0onne ridon \u00fea yldestan men to, ealle \u00fee to \u00fe\u00e6re byrig hyron, &\nGif he nite, hwa hine aborgie, h\u00e6fton hine.\nGif he nylle hit ge\u00feafian, leton hine licgan, buton he o\u00fewinde.\nGif hwa hine wrecan wille o\u00f0\u00f0e hine f\u00e6l\u00e6ce, \u00feonne beo he fah wi\u00f0 \u00f0one cyng & wi\u00f0 ealle his freond.\nGif he \u00e6twinde, & hine hwa feormige, sy he his weres scyldig, buton he hine ladian durre be \u00fe\u00e6s\nGif hwa \u00feingie for ordal, \u00f0ingie on \u00f0am ceapgilde \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6ge, & noht on \u00f0am wite, buton hit se gifan\n& ne underfo nan mon o\u00feres monnes mon, buton his leafe \u00fee he \u00e6r folgode.\nGif hit hwa do, agife \u00feone mon & bete cynges oferhyrnesse.\n& non mon ne t\u00e6ce his getihtledan mon from him, \u00e6r he h\u00e6bbe ryht geworht.\nGif hwa ordales weddige, \u00f0onne cume he \u00ferim nihtum \u00e6r to \u00feam m\u00e6ssepreoste \u00fee hit halgian scyle,\n& gif hit sy w\u00e6ter, \u00f0\u00e6t he gedufe o\u00fere healfe elne on \u00feam rape; gif hit sy ysenordal, beon \u00f0reo niht,\n& ofga \u00e6lc mon his tihtlan mid forea\u00f0e, swa we \u00e6r cw\u00e6don; & beo \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00e6lc f\u00e6stende on \u00e6g\u00feera\nGif se getihtloda mon \u00f0onne maran werude beo \u00feonne twelfa sum, \u00feonne beo \u00fe\u00e6t ordal forod, buton\nOnd se \u00fee yrfe bycge on gewitnesse & hit eft tymon scyle, \u00feonne onfo se his \u00fee he hit \u00e6r \u00e6tbohte, beo\n& \u00f0\u00e6t nan cyping ne sy Sunnondagum, gif hit \u00f0onne hwa do, \u00feolige \u00f0\u00e6s ceapes & gesylle XXX\nGif minra gerefena hwylc \u00feonne \u00feis don nylle & l\u00e6s ymbe beo \u00feonne we gecweden habba\u00f0, \u00feonne\nOnd se biscop amonige \u00fea oferhyrnesse \u00e6t \u00feam gerefan, \u00fee hit on his folgo\u00fee sy.\nSe \u00f0e of \u00f0issa ger\u00e6dnesse ga, gilde \u00e6t frumcirre V pund, \u00e6t o\u00ferum cirre his wer, \u00e6t \u00feriddan cirre\nOnd se \u00f0e mana\u00f0 swerige, & hit him on open wur\u00fee, \u00f0\u00e6t he n\u00e6fre eft a\u00f0wyr\u00fee ne sy, ne binnon nanum\n& his scrift hit gecy\u00fee \u00feam biscope binnon XXX nihta, hwe\u00feer he to \u00fe\u00e6re bote cirran wolde.\nGif he swa ne do, bete be \u00feam \u00fee se biscop him forgifan wille.",
